---
// Side-by-side dead-code elimination assembly vs package-level sink / Go 1.24 b.Loop().
const W = 900;
const H = 280;
---
<figure class="goblc">
  <div class="goblc-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Comparison showing how Go's compiler deletes an ignored benchmark call in assembly versus preserving execution with package sink or Go 1.24 b.Loop().">
      {/* Left panel: Eliminated */}
      <rect x="14" y="14" width="430" height="252" rx="10" class="goblc-card is-red" />
      <text x="30" y="42" class="goblc-b-red">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Fake 0.31 ns/op: dead-code elimination in SSA pass</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Số đo ảo 0.31 ns/op: pha SSA xóa trắng hàm không đọc kết quả</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="30" y="58" width="398" height="68" rx="6" class="goblc-box" />
      <text x="44" y="78" class="goblc-code">for i := 0; i &lt; b.N; i++ {'{'}</text>
      <text x="44" y="96" class="goblc-code">    computeMask(input, uint64(i)) // discarded!</text>
      <text x="44" y="114" class="goblc-code">{'}'}</text>

      <rect x="30" y="140" width="398" height="110" rx="6" class="goblc-box" />
      <text x="44" y="162" class="goblc-b-red">Generated ARM64 / x86 Assembly:</text>
      <text x="44" y="182" class="goblc-code">LOOP: SUB $1, R1  ; CBZ R1, EXIT</text>
      <text x="44" y="202" class="goblc-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Entire computeMask body vanished during SSA pass!</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Toàn bộ tính toán bên trong bốc hơi, chỉ còn đúng vòng đếm rỗng!</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="44" y="222" class="goblc-b-red">Measured Apple M2: 0.3119 ns/op (meaningless)</text>

      {/* Right panel: Honest sink / b.Loop() */}
      <rect x="460" y="14" width="426" height="252" rx="10" class="goblc-card" />
      <text x="476" y="42" class="goblc-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Honest benchmark: exported Sink or Go 1.24+ for b.Loop()</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Đo thật trung thực: biến package Sink hoặc for b.Loop()</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="476" y="58" width="394" height="68" rx="6" class="goblc-box is-ok" />
      <text x="490" y="78" class="goblc-code">for b.Loop() {'{'}</text>
      <text x="490" y="96" class="goblc-code">    acc += computeMask(input, step)</text>
      <text x="490" y="114" class="goblc-code">{'}'}; globalResult = acc // package var forces emit!</text>

      <rect x="476" y="140" width="394" height="110" rx="6" class="goblc-box is-ok" />
      <text x="490" y="162" class="goblc-b-ok">Compiler guarantees real instruction execution:</text>
      <text x="490" y="182" class="goblc-code">for b.Loop() keeps params &amp; side-effects alive</text>
      <text x="490" y="202" class="goblc-m">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Plus auto-calls ResetTimer() on entry so setup never pollutes B/op.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tự động reset đồng hồ trước vòng 0 nên không lo setup làm bẩn B/op.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="490" y="222" class="goblc-b-ok">Pair always with -benchmem -count=6..10 + benchstat</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Pure inlined calls whose values go unread get deleted completely by Go's SSA optimizer. Exporting accumulated state to a package sink—or upgrading to for b.Loop() in Go 1.24+—forces faithful measurement.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Các hàm thuần không dùng kết quả trả về dễ dàng bị pha SSA cắt sạch lúc biên dịch. Dồn kết quả vào biến package sink hoặc chuyển sang for b.Loop() (Go 1.24+) giữ mã thực thi chuẩn xác.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .goblc { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .goblc-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .goblc svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 660px; height: auto; }
  .goblc text { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .goblc-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .goblc-card.is-red { stroke: var(--red); fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .goblc-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .goblc-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .goblc-box.is-ok { stroke: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .goblc-h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .goblc-b-red { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .goblc-b-ok { font-weight: 700; fill: rgb(21, 128, 61); }
  :global(html[data-theme='dark']) .goblc-b-ok { fill: rgb(74, 222, 128); }
  .goblc-code { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 11px; fill: var(--text); }
  .goblc-m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 11px; }
  .goblc figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
